nethack 3.0h6, Unix BSD HARD vanilla:

if for some reason you have a collection of several loadstones,
let's say 7 in your inventory you'll notice that you can't move.
so you decide to drop 6 of them which you can't do! when you look
at your inventory of stones you'll now see:
r - 6 cursed loadstones
r - a cursed loadstone
you can repeat this process as in try to drop 5 r's but you won't
be able to and now your inventory is:
r - 5 cursed loadstones
r - a cursed loadstone
r - a cursed loadstone
don't do this at home if you can't get the curse off the stones.
when i #dipped r into holy water i was able to drop the 5 stones
and i was left with:
r - a cursed loadstone
r - a cursed loadstone
#dipping two more times got rid of the stones. the expanded inventory
slot is a definite loser ...

